#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:250
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YouveMadeItToMe"
msgid ""
"Aak!\n"
"You've made it to me?\l"
"Hmmm… You're sharp!$"
msgstr ""
"啊啊！你居然找到我了？\n"
"嗯……你很敏锐嘛！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToPlantTrees"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to plant all those\n"
"trees…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness by\n"
"one, two, three, four, five, six places!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才种好那些树……\p"
"你离我的伟大只差一、二、\n"
"三、四、五、六个名次了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:261
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToMakeMaze"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to make the maze…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness by\n"
"one, two, three, four, five places!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才做好那个迷宫……\p"
"你离我的伟大只差一、二、\n"
"三、四、五个名次了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:266
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToPreparePanels"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to prepare\n"
"the wall panels…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness by\n"
"one, two, three, four places!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才准备好那些墙板……\p"
"你离我的伟大只差一、\n"
"二、三、四个名次了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToShoveBoulders"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to shove in those\n"
"boulders…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness by\n"
"one, two, three places!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才把那些大石头推进去……\p"
"你离我的伟大只差一、二、三个名次了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToMakeMechadolls"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to make MECHADOLLS\n"
"and another to think up the quiz…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness by\n"
"one, two places!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚做机关人偶，\n"
"又花了一整晚想测验题……\p"
"你离我的伟大只差一、二个名次了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToInstallDoors"
msgid ""
"It took me all night to install\n"
"the doors…\p"
"You're almost my equal in greatness!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才装好那些门……\p"
"你差不多和我一样伟大了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:289
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightSettingUpArrows"
msgid ""
"It took me all night setting up arrows…\p"
"You're my equal in greatness!$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚才设置好那些箭头……\p"
"你和我一样伟大了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:293
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightPolishingFloors"
msgid ""
"It took me all night polishing floors…\p"
"You're above me in greatness!\n"
"Possibly…$"
msgstr ""
"我花了一整晚把地板擦得亮亮的……\p"
"你比我还要伟大！大概吧……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_FountainOfIdeasRunDry"
msgid ""
"Wh-what should I do?\n"
"My fountain of ideas for tricks has\l"
"run dry…\p"
"Perhaps it is time I toured the country\n"
"on a quest to devise new tricks…$"
msgstr ""
"怎、怎么办？我设计机关的\n"
"灵感源泉已经枯竭了……\p"
"也许是时候周游全国，\n"
"去寻找设计新机关的灵感了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_DefeatedMePreferWhichTent"
msgid ""
"I hate to admit defeat, but you have\n"
"bested me!\p"
"Still, you must have been reeled in by\n"
"my charisma for you to visit me again\l"
"and again. Yes, you must have!\p"
"But that has nothing to do with my\n"
"losing!\p"
"In recognition of the friendship\n"
"between you, the driven, and the genius\l"
"that is myself, I demand that you take\l"
"this keepsake!\p"
"Actually there are two--\n"
"a RED TENT and a BLUE TENT.\l"
"Which do you prefer?$"
msgstr ""
"虽然很不甘心，但我承认我输了！\p"
"不过，你一次又一次地来找我，\n"
"一定是被我的魅力吸引了吧。\l"
"没错，一定是这样！\p"
"但这和我输了没有任何关系！\p"
"为了纪念你这位执着的人和\n"
"我这位天才之间的友谊，\l"
"我命令你收下这份纪念品！\p"
"其实有两样——红色帐篷和蓝色帐篷。\n"
"你喜欢哪一个？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_NoRoomInPC"
msgid ""
"What? No room in your PC?\n"
"What am I to make of that?\p"
"I wish I could say that, but I am much\n"
"too kind and caring, so come back later!$"
msgstr ""
"什么？你的电脑里没有空间了？\n"
"这叫我怎么办？\p"
"我很想这么说，但我实在是太善良、\n"
"太体贴了，所以你晚点再来吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_LeavingOnJourney"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"I am leaving on a journey of discovery.\n"
"A quest in search of new tricks.\p"
"I wish that you will one day visit and\n"
"entertain me again.\p"
"And now, farewell!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"我要踏上探索之旅了。去寻找新的机关。\p"
"希望有一天你能再来，让我开心开心。\p"
"那么，再会了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:335
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YouHaveEarnedThisReward"
msgid ""
"Fine!\n"
"You have earned this reward!$"
msgstr "好吧！这是你应得的奖励！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_NoRoomForThis"
msgid ""
"What? Have you no room for this?\n"
"What manner of items do you carry?\p"
"But fine, since you've reached me,\n"
"your reward will be with me till later.$"
msgstr ""
"什么？你没地方放这个了？\n"
"你到底都带了些什么东西啊？\p"
"不过算了，既然你找到了我，\n"
"奖励就先放在我这里吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_MakeNewTricksToStumpYou"
msgid ""
"Scrub that smug smirk from your face!\n"
"It's much too early to think you've won!\p"
"I'll make new tricks to stump you, I will.\n"
"You may mock me only when you're done.\p"
"Come back for the next exciting\n"
"installment!$"
msgstr ""
"把你脸上那副得意的笑容收起来！\n"
"现在就以为自己赢了还太早了！\p"
"我会设计新的机关来难倒你的，一定会！\n"
"等你全部破解了，再来嘲笑我吧。\p"
"敬请期待下一回的精彩挑战！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEnd/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YoureIgnoringMe"
msgid ""
"Now, now! You're ignoring me now?\n"
"Now that, I consider heartbreaking!$"
msgstr ""
"喂喂！你现在是在无视我吗？\n"
"这可真让我伤心啊！$"
